**Whiplash Mix**

The DJ snaps the night to neon flash;  
His crossfade courts a comic collision.  
We dash so hard we dance ourselves to hash.  

His whip-crack hi-hats dish out pure whiplash;  
The bassline bumps with bumper precision.  
The DJ snaps the night to neon flash.  

He drums our skulls like one calabash;  
Our eyeballs bop in bright double vision.  
We dash so hard we dance ourselves to hash.  

Scratch-skit, kick-click—the cymbals clash;  
Each drop explodes by wicked decision.  
The DJ snaps the night to neon flash.  

We duck-dip, pogo-pivot, dart and dash;  
He parks the groove with surgical precision.  
We dash so hard we dance ourselves to hash.  

We tip him all our chiropractor cash,  
Then beg one last ecstatic collision:  
The DJ snaps the night to neon flash;  
We dash so hard we dance ourselves to hash.
